  "historyNote": "#5053, eff 1-24-91; ss by #5886, eff 8-26-94; amd by #7207-B, eff 2-26-00; ss by #7333, eff 8-1-00; ss by #9215, INTERIM, eff 8-1-08; (See Revision Note #1 at chapter heading for Env-Hw 700) ss by #9367, eff 1-28-09; amd by #10739, eff 12-2-14; ss by #12349, eff 8-14-17 (formerly Env-Hw 707.03); ss by #14281, eff 8-1-25, EXPIRES: 8-1-35",
